1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,200
Lin Yao walks along the misty shore.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:08,000
She finds a glowing jade pendant in the sand.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,500
The light bursts, a green vortex opens in the sky.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:16,500
She falls onto a giant mushroom; ShanHaiJie reveals itself.

5
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:20,500
The mysterious silver-haired Mo Yuan appears: 'You are finally here.'

6
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:26,000
Their eyes meet --

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Suddenly! A huge black bird descends from the sky!

8
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Mo Yuan grabs her; they leap together into the waterfall.

